    {
      "s": "dong_chinese",
      "t": "Depicts a boat (舟) moving (止) forward (前)."
    },
    {
      "s": "shuowen_jiezi",
      "t": "不行而進謂之歬。从止在舟上。",
      "w": 1
    },
    {
      "s": "wiktionary",
      "t": "Originally 歬, an ideogrammic compound (會意 /会意): 止 (“foot”) + 舟 (“boat”) – a foot on a boat moving forward.\nIn the current form, 止 is simplified to 䒑 and 舟 to 月. The current form with an additional 刀 (“knife”) (𠝣 > 𣦃 > 前) is the original form of 剪 (OC *ʔslenʔ, “to cut”).\nUnrelated to 俞.\nUnknown (Schuessler, 2007)."
    }
  ],
